### Frequently Asked Questions

**Which framework should I choose: Flutter or React Native?**  
Both are exceptional cross-platform frameworks. Inrank typically recommends Flutter for performance-critical, highly customized UI experiences, and React Native if your ecosystem already utilizes a heavy React/TypeScript web codebase.

**How much does mobile app development cost in Pune?**  
Standard MVP mobile applications typically range between ₹75,000 to ₹1,80,000 depending on features, third-party integrations, and backend requirements. Enterprise multi-role apps with custom hardware/IoT integrations are quoted based on detailed sprint specs.

**Will you handle Apple App Store and Google Play Store submission?**  
Yes. Inrank handles the entire store deployment process, including app signing, privacy manifest policies, screenshots, metadata, and responding to App Store review requests until approval is granted.

